  "description": "They grow up so fast, don’t they? One minute they're looking swamped by a too-big school uniform, the next, their gangly arms are poking out the sleeves. That’s why we created the Pop 24: a sophisticated, lightweight kids bike for growing kids. When the training wheels are long gone, when their legs get longer and their dreams get bigger, this big-kid bike will keep them moving. Expertly crafted for kids aged 8-11 (or 129cm-132cm), the 24-inch Pop keeps kids moving forward. Made from a light yet sturdy aluminium frame, chunky tyres and with seven gears to choose from, this bike is guaranteed to make the school run fun, and withstand the biggest adventures. For more detailed size breakdown and tips for measuring your child, check out our kids bike size guide.",
